   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RPP III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RPP III inneb&#xe4;r att &quot;Develop Your Business&quot;-programmet introduceras p&#xe5; ytterligare tre platser i Ryssland, St Petersburg, Smolensk och Pskov. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka  ledarskapskompetensen hos f&#xf6;retagsledare i sm&#xe5; och medelstora f&#xf6;retag i dessa regioner. Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r dessa regioner att sj&#xe4;lva genomf&#xf6;ra ledarskapsutbildningar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RPP III project is about to extend the &quot;Develop Your Business&quot;-programme into three new regions, St Petersburg, Smolensk and Pskov. The overall aim is to increase the management competence in SMEs in the region. The project objective is to make it possible for these institutions to carry out management training in their regions in a sustainable way.</narrative>
  </description>
